flowchart LR
 User[User / Authorized Background Task] --> Copilot[Construction Copilot]
 Copilot --> Context[Authorized Context Builder]
 Context --> Orchestrator[Agent Orchestrator]
 Orchestrator --> Retrieve[Plan/Spec/Project Retrieval]
 Orchestrator --> Agents[Specialized Construction Agents]
 Agents --> P26[Phase 26 Deterministic Tools]
 Agents --> P25[Phase 25 Library Query/Proposal]
 Agents --> Evidence[Evidence + Citations]
 Orchestrator --> Policy[Tool / Risk Policy]
 Policy --> Approval{Human Approval Required?}
 Approval -->|Yes| Human[Authorized Human Reviewer]
 Approval -->|No| Output[Advisory/Task Output]
 Human -->|Approved| Tools[Protected Tool Action]
 Human -->|Rejected| Output
 Tools --> Audit[AI Audit / Trace]
 Output --> Audit
 Audit --> Eval[Monitoring / Evaluation / Feedback]
